<h1>Animation API</h1>
<p class="lead">Apply animations to rigged characters, and list the animations you can apply.</p>
<hr/>
<div class="flex items-center gap-x-3"><span class="font-mono text-[0.625rem] font-semibold leading-6 rounded-lg px-1.5 ring-1 ring-inset ring-sky-300 bg-sky-400/10 text-sky-500 dark:ring-sky-400/30 dark:bg-sky-400/10 dark:text-sky-400">POST</span><span class="h-0.5 w-0.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-600"></span><span class="min-w-0 break-all font-mono text-xs text-zinc-400">/openapi/v1/animations</span></div><h2 class="mt-2 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-h)+4rem)] text-xl pb-2 mb-8" id="create-an-animation-task"><a class="group text-inherit no-underline hover:text-inherit" href="#create-an-animation-task">Create an Animation task</a></h2>
<div data-reference-row="true" class="grid min-w-0 grid-cols-1 items-start gap-y-8 gap-x-(--row-gap) [--row-gap:2rem] xl:[--row-gap:2.5rem] 2xl:[--row-gap:3rem] @min-[53rem]:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_min(36rem,calc((100%_-_var(--row-gap))/2))] @min-[53rem]:grid-rows-[auto_1fr] @min-[53rem]:gap-y-0"><div data-row-intro="true" class="min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;[aria-hidden]:first-child+*]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:last-child]:mb-0 @min-[53rem]:col-start-1 @min-[53rem]:row-start-1"><p>Creates an Animation task, which applies an animation to a character you rigged earlier. The animation can be one of the following:</p><ul>
<li>A preset action from the animation library (<code>action_id</code>)</li>
<li>Several preset actions merged into one file (<code>action_ids</code>)</li>
<li>A motion clip you generated with the <a class="text-meshy-700 hover:text-meshy-800 dark:text-meshy-500 dark:hover:text-meshy-300 inline-flex justify-center items-center" href="/api/text-to-motion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Text to Motion API<svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="h-4 w-4"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M6.04159 5.83331C6.04159 5.48814 6.32141 5.20831 6.66659 5.20831H14.1666C14.5118 5.20831 14.7916 5.48814 14.7916 5.83331V13.3333C14.7916 13.6785 14.5118 13.9583 14.1666 13.9583C13.8214 13.9583 13.5416 13.6785 13.5416 13.3333V7.3422L6.27519 14.6086C6.03112 14.8527 5.63539 14.8527 5.39131 14.6086C5.14723 14.3645 5.14723 13.9688 5.39131 13.7247L12.6577 6.45831H6.66659C6.32141 6.45831 6.04159 6.17849 6.04159 5.83331Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a> (<code>motion_task_id</code>)</li>
</ul><p>You can also post-process the output. The task runs in the background. For how long a task usually takes, see <a href="/en/api/task-lifecycle#processing-times">Processing times</a>.</p></div><div data-sticky-col="true" class="min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;[aria-hidden]:first-child+*]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:last-child]:mb-0 @min-[53rem]:col-start-2 @min-[53rem]:row-span-2 @min-[53rem]:row-start-1 @min-[53rem]:sticky @min-[53rem]:top-[calc(var(--header-h)+1rem-1px)] @min-[53rem]:max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--header-h)-2rem+2px)] @min-[53rem]:has-[[data-try-it]]:max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--header-h)-1rem+2px)] @min-[53rem]:overflow-y-auto @min-[53rem]:-m-px @min-[53rem]:p-px"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" style="position:fixed;top:1px;left:1px;width:1px;height:0;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;border-width:0"></button><div class="max-w-3xl not-prose my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 shadow-md dark:ring-1 dark:ring-white/10" data-code-group="true"><div class="flex min-h-[calc(theme(spacing.12)+1px)] flex-wrap items-start gap-x-4 border-b border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-800 px-4 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-transparent"><h3 class="mr-auto pt-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Request</h3><div class="-mb-px flex gap-4 text-xs font-medium" role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal"><button class="border-b py-3 transition ui-not-focus-visible:outline-none border-meshy-500 text-meshy-500" id="headlessui-tabs-tab-_R_6con5bsnpfmmivb_" role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-headlessui-state="selected" data-selected="">cURL</button><button class="border-b py-3 transition ui-not-focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-300" id="headlessui-tabs-tab-_R_acon5bsnpfmmivb_" role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-headlessui-state="">JavaScript</button><button class="border-b py-3 transition ui-not-focus-visible:outline-none border