, and other MCP-compatible tools. Or point your AI coding assistant at llms.txt for a token-efficient integration guide.\",\"Title\":\"AI Integration\"},\"Animation\":{\"Description\":\"The Animation API allows you to apply animations to rigged 3D models using Meshy's backend capabilities. This section provides the necessary details to integrate animation into your application.\",\"Title\":\"Animation API\"},\"AnimationLibrary\":{\"Description\":\"This page provides a comprehensive reference of all available animations in Meshy's Auto-Rigging \u0026 Animation API. Each animation is identified by a unique action_id that can be used when creating animation tasks.\",\"Table\":{\"category\":\"Category\",\"id\":\"ID\",\"name\":\"Name\",\"preview\":\"Preview\",\"subCategory\":\"SubCategory\"},\"Title\":\"Animation Library Reference\"},\"AssetRetention\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy retains your assets for a maximum of 3 days if you're not an Enterprise customer. Enterprise customers can retain their assets indefinitely.\",\"Title\":\"Asset Retention\"},\"Authentication\":{\"Description\":\"Using the Meshy API requires authentication. This guide will show you how to create an account and API keys.\",\"Title\":\"Authentication\"},\"AutoSplit\":{\"Description\":\"The Auto Split API splits a 3D model into separately printable parts — automatically, by the parts you name, or by color region — with optional connectors and thin-wall reinforcement for 3D printing.\",\"Title\":\"Auto Split API\"},\"Balance\":{\"Description\":\"The Balance API allows you to retrieve the current credit balance for your account.\",\"Title\":\"Balance API\"},\"Changelog\":{\"Description\":\"See all of the latest features and updates to the Meshy API and plugins.\",\"Title\":\"Changelog\"},\"Convert\":{\"Description\":\"The Convert API allows you to convert 3D models between formats (GLB, FBX, OBJ, STL, USDZ, BLEND, 3MF) without modifying the mesh or dimensions. 1 credit per task.\",\"Title\":\"Convert API\"},\"CreativeLabBrickFigure\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a source photo into a brick-style collectible 3D minifigure. Two-stage workflow: prototype generates a styled concept image, build turns it into a textured 3D model.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Brick Figure API\"},\"CreativeLabCollapsibleFidget\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a source photo into a print-in-place collapsible fidget toy. Single-stage workflow: one request turns the silhouette into nested concentric rings that collapse flat and stretch out again, printed in one piece with no assembly.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Collapsible Fidget API\"},\"CreativeLabFidgetPixel\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a source photo into a multi-color 3D-printable pixel-art fidget board. Two-stage workflow: prototype pixelizes the photo into a pixel-art image, build turns it into interlocking square or hex pieces delivered as a color-tagged 3MF.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Fidget Pixel API\"},\"CreativeLabFigure\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a source photo into a chibi-style collectible 3D figure. Two-stage workflow: prototype generates a styled concept image, build turns it into a textured 3D model.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Figure API\"},\"CreativeLabFridgeMagnet\":{\"Description\":\"Generate a custom fridge magnet — a colorized depth relief with a flat magnetic back — from a source photo via the prototype → build flow.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Fridge Magnet API\"},\"CreativeLabKeycap\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a source photo into a full-color custom mechanical keyboard keycap. Two-stage workflow: prototype generates one finished-keycap design image, build turns that design into a textured 3D keycap model.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Keycap API\"},\"CreativeLabKeychain\":{\"Description\":\"Generate a 3D-printable keychain medallion from a source photo via the prototype → build flow.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Keychain API\"},\"CreativeLabLamp\":{\"Description\":\"Generate a 3D-printable lampshade from text or a source photo via the prototype → build flow.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Lamp API\"},\"CreativeLabVinylFigure\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a source photo into a big-head vinyl collectible 3D figure. Two-stage workflow: prototype generates a styled concept image, build turns it into a textured 3D model.\",\"Title\":\"Creative Lab — Vinyl Figure API\"},\"Deprecations\":{\"Description\":\"Which Meshy AI models and API features are deprecated or retired, when they stop working, and what to use instead.\",\"Title\":\"Deprecations\"},\"DeveloperPlatform\":{\"Description\":\"Run requests in the Playground, monitor usage and request logs, and manage API keys and webhooks — everything about your Meshy API integration in one place.\",\"Title\":\"Developer Platform\"},\"Errors\":{\"Description\":\"In this guide, we will talk about what happens when something goes wrong while you work with the Meshy API.\",\"Title\":\"Errors\"},\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Image to 3D API is a feature that allows you to integrate Meshy's Image to 3D capabilities into your own application. In this section, you'll find all the information you need to get started with this API.\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D API\"},\"ImageTo3d\":{\"Description\":\"Image to 3D API is a feature that allows you to integrate Meshy's Image to 3D capabilities into your own application. In this section, you'll find all the information you need to get started with this API.\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D API\"},\"ImageToImage\":{\"Description\":\"Image to Image API is a feature that allows you to integrate Meshy's AI image editing capabilities into your own application. Transform and edit existing images using reference images and text prompts.\",\"Title\":\"Image to Image API\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Tag API tasks with your own key-value pairs in the X-Meshy-Metadata header, and read them back on usage records.\",\"Title\":\"Metadata\"},\"MultiImageTo3d\":{\"Description\":\"Multi-Image to 3D API allows you to generate 3D models from multiple input images using Meshy's capabilities. This section provides all the information you need to get started.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-Image to 3D API\"},\"Pricing\":{\"Description\":\"Simple and flexible pricing. Only pay for what you use.\",\"Title\":\"Pricing\"},\"Print\":{\"Description\":\"The Multi-Color Print API converts 3D models into multi-color 3MF format optimized for 3D printing with configurable color palettes and precision.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-Color Print API\"},\"Printability\":{\"Description\":\"Analyze a 3D model for FDM printability — watertightness, volume, holes, non-manifold edges, degenerate faces. Free, no credits consumed.\",\"Title\":\"Analyze Printability API\"},\"QuickStart\":{\"Description\":\"Learn how to quickly setup your development environment and use Meshy API to generate 3D models and textures from text prompts and images.\",\"Title\":\"Quickstart\"},\"RateLimits\":{\"Description\":\"Rate limits are restrictions that our API imposes on the number of times a user or client can access our services within a specified period of time.\",\"Title\":\"Rate Limits\"},\"Remesh\":{\"Description\":\"The Remesh API allows you to remesh and export existing 3D models generated by other Meshy APIs into various formats. This section provides details on how to use the Remesh API.\",\"Title\":\"Remesh API\"},\"RepairPrintability\":{\"Description\":\"Repair a 3D model for FDM printability — fix non-manifold edges, degenerate faces, holes, and other topology issues. 10 credits per task.\",\"Title\":\"Repair Printability API\"},\"Resize\":{\"Description\":\"The Resize API allows you to resize 3D models to specific physical dimensions. Supports height, longest-side, and AI auto-size modes. Output preserves the input format when using model_url; defaults to GLB for input_task_id. 1 credit per task.\",\"Title\":\"Resize API\"},\"Retexture\":{\"Description\":\"Retexture API is a feature that allows you to integrate Meshy's AI retexturing capabilities in